 (19, 'The first continuity run after the 20 h threshold (snapshot 2 at 2026-10-10T06:26:16Z, run 38030575259) uploaded an Actions artifact named continuity-snapshot.', 1, 'continuity_snapshots id 1 ts 2026-10-09T09:50:24Z, id 2 ts 2026-10-10T06:26:16Z artifact = actions artifact continuity-snapshot run 38030575259; GitHub artifacts?name=continuity-snapshot: id 11661678506 created 2026-10-10T06:26:19Z for run 38030575259, then runs 38106996385, 38182698852, 38297013310.'),
